{"4519070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MOVILLIA", "steam_appid": 4519070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Earth has changed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The meteor brought more than destruction - it brought something that altered the very nature of the planet. Within a few decades, Earth's ecosystem twisted <strong>beyond recognition</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're part of an expedition sent to study how your home world transformed. But a landing accident drags your team deep into the planet's core. Cut off from the surface, with no map and no hope of quick rescue, you must cross an entire <strong>alien ecosystem</strong> to find a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/bcf9eed6c93afca2d48bcd536d782391.poster.avif?t=1788042754\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/bcf9eed6c93afca2d48bcd536d782391.webm?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/bcf9eed6c93afca2d48bcd536d782391.mp4?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world without sun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The MOVILLIA ecosystem evolved in complete isolation, birthing life forms that have never known a human. <strong>Glowing spores</strong>, crystalline caverns, <strong>rusted remains of machinery</strong> left by those who came before you - every biome carries traces of someone else's survival. And not everything you find was meant to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/64dcc02195465f84a1ced160eae61f49.poster.avif?t=1788042754\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/64dcc02195465f84a1ced160eae61f49.webm?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/64dcc02195465f84a1ced160eae61f49.mp4?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your tools are your only link to reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, sight deceives, and any stray light draws predators. Use your <strong>echolocator</strong> to map the darkness with a <strong>point cloud</strong> without making a sound. Scan flora, fauna, minerals, and the remnants of those who came before. Your <strong>scanner-analyzer</strong> will collect the data and display it right on your <strong>helmet's HUD</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/439218c10d448e1ee101afb52d9072c7.poster.avif?t=1788042754\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/439218c10d448e1ee101afb52d9072c7.webm?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/439218c10d448e1ee101afb52d9072c7.mp4?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/b7db3591a8524f99448d7ad6c5c57566.poster.avif?t=1788042754\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/b7db3591a8524f99448d7ad6c5c57566.webm?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/b7db3591a8524f99448d7ad6c5c57566.mp4?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt to survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every discovery is a new piece of your survival blueprint. Data from your scanner feeds into your <strong>wrist terminal</strong>: craft tools, swap gear, monitor your vitals. You're not just surviving - you're learning the rules of an alien world, so you can one day <strong>master them</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/a67a89462e597bb9139376e55b80e98d.poster.avif?t=1788042754\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/a67a89462e597bb9139376e55b80e98d.webm?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/a67a89462e597bb9139376e55b80e98d.mp4?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/1a19e35251ca7bc3dd81b4fc9c24d516.poster.avif?t=1788042754\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/1a19e35251ca7bc3dd81b4fc9c24d516.webm?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/1a19e35251ca7bc3dd81b4fc9c24d516.mp4?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The depths beckon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From <strong>magma rifts</strong> to <strong>methane lakes</strong> with warped gravity - the world of <strong>MOVILLIA</strong> feels endless. Tame local creatures, drill through obstacles, and grapple across chasms with your <strong>harpoon</strong>. But remember: the deeper you go, the more answers this planet demands in return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/0286dc6331b1c29a8bb1f1381e94092e.poster.avif?t=1788042754\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/0286dc6331b1c29a8bb1f1381e94092e.webm?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4519070/extras/0286dc6331b1c29a8bb1f1381e94092e.mp4?t=1788042754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a living, mutated ecosystem:</strong> flora, fauna, minerals, and traces of a vanished expedition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scan and analyze</strong> your discoveries with a scanner-analyzer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use echolocation</strong> to navigate stealthily through the dark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep</strong> <strong>crafting system</strong> built from the data you collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical gameplay:</strong> harpoons, drilling rigs, and tamed creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense survival horror</strong> where the darkness is an active threat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So — are you ready to face this horror head-on? Add <strong>MOVILLIA</strong> to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>. The 